            "accordion_row_KQjKqw": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "What's included in every booking?",
                "open_by_default": true,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_DAzGcD": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Every session includes access to:</p><ul><li>Pre-set lighting setups (no adjustments required)</li><li>Phone tripod + ring light (familiar, comfortable, optional)<br/></li><li>White wall + backdrop shooting zones. Both 8ft and 4ft seamless in neutral colours and fabric backdrop options.<br/></li><li>Product flat-lay areas (bed + table setups)<br/></li><li>The Green Room<br/> – makeup mirror<br/> – seating<br/> – wardrobe space<br/> – steamer<br/> – privacy<br/>Power, extensions, and basic props</li></ul><p>Optional add-ons available at booking:</p><p>Lav mic (phone) • Mini/wand mic • Podcast desk mics • Quick founder Q&A</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
